{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtV2BoDKeLCu4K59wJtq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A `save_fact` no longer evicts the static instructions from the prompt cache. The change is in `bot.py` (`build_system`), with a note in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n**Cause:** the instructions and the per-athlete facts were one text block with a single `cache_control` marker. Every `save_fact` changed that block, so the next call re-cached the whole system prompt.\n\n**Fix:** the system prompt is now two blocks. The static `INSTRUCTIONS` block carries the cache marker. The athlete block (profile, zones, facts, date) follows it without a marker, so a fact change or a new day only misses the small block.\n\nI also updated the caching paragraph in `README.md` to match.\n\n**Verification:** offline only. I stubbed the LLM and ran a `save_fact` turn followed by a normal turn. The instructions block was identical across both calls, the new fact appeared only in the athlete block, and the marker sat only on the instructions block. I did not call the API, so the actual cache hit rate is unmeasured.\n\n**Caveats (details in `ANSWER.md`):**\n- **Minimum cacheable length:** the instructions are roughly 600–700 tokens, which may be below the model's minimum cacheable prefix. If so, the marker is silently ignored. After deploying, check that `cache_read_input_tokens` in `logs/usage.jsonl` stays near the static prefix size after a `save_fact`.\n- **Tool-group switching still evicts the cache:** a message with plan or race keywords changes the tool list, and tools come before the system prompt in the cache order. The log shows this on `plan_week` and `predict_race` turns. I left it alone because the keyword filter is a documented win. Always sending the full tool list would avoid those misses but cost more on every call. That trade-off is yours to make.\n\nI did not commit anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1586,"cache_read_input_tokens":35678,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1586},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d385bd50-de69-4c58-bbf3-a6a5f4cc3b93","uuid":"1845838a-e870-41da-96c0-be0810ea24c4","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:47:41.703Z","request_id":"req_011CgtV2BcJVySn5APes8ygu"}
